{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33796","headline":"太湖诗 明月湾 · 皮日休","name":"太湖诗 明月湾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓景澹无际，孤舟恣回环。\n试问最幽处，号爲明月湾。\n半岩翡翠巢，望见不可攀。\n柳弱下丝网，藤深垂花鬘。\n松瘿忽似狖，石文或如虥。\n钓坛两三处，苔老腥斒斑。\n沙雨几处霁，水禽相向闲。\n野人波涛上，白屋幽深间。\n晓培橘栽去，暮作鱼梁还。\n清泉出石砌，好树临柴关。\n对此老且死，不知忧与患。\n好境无处住，好处无境删。\n赧然不自适，脉脉当湖山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33796.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33796","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}